<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:00:06 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>潜在的 RadioShack 复兴者和解 SEC 欺诈诉讼指控</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/would-be-radioshack-revivers-settle-sec-fraud-suit-allegations</link><description>三名企业家被指控在疫情期间误导投资者，以重振包括 RadioShack 和 Pier 1 Imports 在内的陷入困境的零售商，他们同意支付超过 680 万美元，以结束美国监管机构声称他们正在进行庞氏骗局的诉讼。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/would-be-radioshack-revivers-settle-sec-fraud-suit-allegations'&gt;潜在的 RadioShack 复兴者和解 SEC 欺诈诉讼指控&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Would-Be RadioShack Revivers Settle SEC Fraud Suit Allegations&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/would-be-radioshack-revivers-settle-sec-fraud-suit-allegations</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:44:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>前官员称中国2027年经济增速将突破4.5%</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/china-2027-growth-to-top-4-5-ex-official-says-video</link><description>前财政部副部长朱光耀表示，2027年中国经济有望增长4.5%以上。朱周三在新加坡接受彭博电视台艾薇儿·洪 (Avril Hong) 采访时指出，北京明年仍有放松财政政策的空间，同时也强调人工智能监管的必要性。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/china-2027-growth-to-top-4-5-ex-official-says-video'&gt;前官员称中国2027年经济增速将突破4.5%&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China 2027 Growth to Top 4.5%, Ex-Official Says&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/china-2027-growth-to-top-4-5-ex-official-says-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:54:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲新兴市场最佳债券反弹在菲律宾延续</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/emerging-asia-s-best-bond-rally-seen-extending-in-philippines</link><description>一些市场观察人士表示，由于价格压力缓解的预期以及具有里程碑意义的全球指数纳入可能会刺激明年的新需求，菲律宾政府债券有望在本月大幅上涨的基础上继续上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/emerging-asia-s-best-bond-rally-seen-extending-in-philippines'&gt;亚洲新兴市场最佳债券反弹在菲律宾延续&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Emerging Asia’s Best Bond Rally Seen Extending in Philippines&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/emerging-asia-s-best-bond-rally-seen-extending-in-philippines</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:05:45 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国通胀数据助长加息押注，金价小幅走低</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-edges-lower-as-us-inflation-data-fuels-bets-for-rate-hikes</link><description>金价在周三上涨后小幅走低，因通胀数据强化了美联储将进一步加息的押注。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-edges-lower-as-us-inflation-data-fuels-bets-for-rate-hikes'&gt;美国通胀数据助长加息押注，金价小幅走低&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Edges Lower as US Inflation Data Fuels Bets for Rate Hikes&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-edges-lower-as-us-inflation-data-fuels-bets-for-rate-hikes</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:18:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Asian Stocks Rise as Dip Buyers Stabilize AI Trade: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>